    "title": "Universal Smart Tv Remote Ctrl",
    "description": "Universal TV Remote Control and Smart TV Remotes App for All Countries. Universal Remote is a free application to control all smart TV functions very easily.\r\n\r\n<b>Useful & Easy to Manage</b>\r\nIt is always good and easy to use a single universal remote control for TV to control all your electronic equipment. As mobile phone has become a major gadget that people always carry with them, having an application installed on your mobile device that works as a TV remote control will make your life easier.\r\n\r\n<b>Watch your favorite Channel</b>\r\nJust right before one of your favorite TV seasons or shows is about to start, OR your favorite sports game is about to begin, OR you want to watch the news and your TV remote is not within your reach then try this universal TV Remote for all TV app. It converts your smartphone into a universal TV remote. You just need to press the channel key to change channels and watch your favorite one.\r\n\r\n<b>Supported Control Smart TV Brands</b>\r\nAlmost all famous TV brands support this universal smart remote like LG TV, Samsung TV, Sony TV, Panasonic TV, and many more.\r\n\r\n<b>Screen Mirroring for all TV</b>\r\nThe screen mirroring feature will provide you the facility to mirror your phone's screen on the smart LED. You can easily shift your mobile display on the big screen of your smart TV. Now play movies or videos on your phone and enjoy watching them on your smart TV screen through the screen mirroring feature. Now you don\u2019t need to connect a cable to the phone to display, all you need is to connect your smartphone and smart TV on the same network.\r\n\r\nUniversal Smart TV Remote Control operates using a Wireless network or Infrared (IR Blaster) from your device for controlling each and every function of your television or any other electronic device. TV Remote is an app that converts your Android device into a universal TV remote control.\r\n\r\n<b>Top Features of Universal TV Remote:-</b>\r\n* Power ON / OFF Control button\r\n* Volume UP / Down Control\r\n* AV / TV\r\n* Mute / Un-Mute\r\n* Channel Digits buttons\r\n* Menu Button with up / down and left / right control\r\n* Channel index and lists\r\n* Red / Pink / Yellow / Green (Multiple purpose keys)\r\n* Control all smart TVs\r\n\r\n<b>Universal remote control for TV</b>\r\nThis is the best remote control unit for Roku TV. You will be able to control the playback of your content, run apps on Roku, and enter text. A large touchpad will make navigation through the menu and content incredibly handy. You will be able to adjust the volume of your Roku smart TV and switch your favorite channels.\r\n\r\n<b>Important Note</b>\r\nEnjoy using the TV remote control app! Don\u2019t forget to leave your positive comment and tell us about your TV remote and TV brands to which you want to be added to our universal remote app. Thanks",
    "descriptionHTML": "Universal TV Remote Control and Smart TV Remotes App for All Countries. Universal Remote is a free application to control all smart TV functions very easily.<br><br><b>Useful &amp; Easy to Manage</b><br>It is always good and easy to use a single universal remote control for TV to control all your electronic equipment. As mobile phone has become a major gadget that people always carry with them, having an application installed on your mobile device that works as a TV remote control will make your life easier.<br><br><b>Watch your favorite Channel</b><br>Just right before one of your favorite TV seasons or shows is about to start, OR your favorite sports game is about to begin, OR you want to watch the news and your TV remote is not within your reach then try this universal TV Remote for all TV app. It converts your smartphone into a universal TV remote. You just need to press the channel key to change channels and watch your favorite one.<br><br><b>Supported Control Smart TV Brands</b><br>Almost all famous TV brands support this universal smart remote like LG TV, Samsung TV, Sony TV, Panasonic TV, and many more.<br><br><b>Screen Mirroring for all TV</b><br>The screen mirroring feature will provide you the facility to mirror your phone&#39;s screen on the smart LED. You can easily shift your mobile display on the big screen of your smart TV. Now play movies or videos on your phone and enjoy watching them on your smart TV screen through the screen mirroring feature. Now you don\u2019t need to connect a cable to the phone to display, all you need is to connect your smartphone and smart TV on the same network.<br><br>Universal Smart TV Remote Control operates using a Wireless network or Infrared (IR Blaster) from your device for controlling each and every function of your television or any other electronic device. TV Remote is an app that converts your Android device into a universal TV remote control.<br><br><b>Top Features of Universal TV Remote:-</b><br>* Power ON / OFF Control button<br>* Volume UP / Down Control<br>* AV / TV<br>* Mute / Un-Mute<br>* Channel Digits buttons<br>* Menu Button with up / down and left / right control<br>* Channel index and lists<br>* Red / Pink / Yellow / Green (Multiple purpose keys)<br>* Control all smart TVs<br><br><b>Universal remote control for TV</b><br>This is the best remote control unit for Roku TV. You will be able to control the playback of your content, run apps on Roku, and enter text. A large touchpad will make navigation through the menu and content incredibly handy. You will be able to adjust the volume of your Roku smart TV and switch your favorite channels.<br><br><b>Important Note</b><br>Enjoy using the TV remote control app! Don\u2019t forget to leave your positive comment and tell us about your TV remote and TV brands to which you want to be added to our universal remote app. Thanks",
